# Taiwan food and dessert words that no upstream dictionary has, or has under only one script or
# one reading. Hand-curated; `tools/build_word_list.py` validates every reading, counts each word
# in the Taiwan corpus and writes food.tsv, which is what build_pinyin_dict.py reads.
#
# traditional<TAB>simplified<TAB>readings
#   simplified  `=` when it is spelled the same, `-` when there is no mainland entry to add
#   readings    one or more, separated by `;` -- every one a way people actually type the word
#
# A word already in the dictionary under some reading may still be listed: an entry only adds
# the readings and scripts it is missing, and the builder keeps the larger of two weights.

# --- shaved ice ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
雪花冰	=	xue hua bing
剉冰	=	cuo bing
挫冰	=	cuo bing
綿綿冰	绵绵冰	mian mian bing
愛玉冰	爱玉冰	ai yu bing
芋頭冰	芋头冰	yu tou bing
八寶冰	八宝冰	ba bao bing
牛奶冰	=	niu nai bing
鳳梨冰	凤梨冰	feng li bing
草莓冰	=	cao mei bing
豆花冰	=	dou hua bing
蜜豆冰	=	mi dou bing
霜淇淋	=	shuang qi lin

# --- jellies and puddings ----------------------------------------------------------------------
杏仁凍	杏仁冻	xing ren dong
仙草凍	仙草冻	xian cao dong
奶凍	奶冻	nai dong
咖啡凍	咖啡冻	ka fei dong
茶凍	茶冻	cha dong
龜苓膏	龟苓膏	gui ling gao
雙皮奶	双皮奶	shuang pi nai
豆腐腦	豆腐脑	dou fu nao
檸檬愛玉	柠檬爱玉	ning meng ai yu

# --- sweet soups and balls ---------------------------------------------------------------------
燒仙草	烧仙草	shao xian cao
芋圓	芋圆	yu yuan
地瓜圓	地瓜圆	di gua yuan
地瓜球	=	di gua qiu
芋泥球	=	yu ni qiu
紅豆湯圓	红豆汤圆	hong dou tang yuan
花生湯	花生汤	hua sheng tang
綠豆沙	绿豆沙	lv dou sha
仙草茶	=	xian cao cha
青蛙撞奶	=	qing wa zhuang nai
珍奶	=	zhen nai

# --- cakes and pastries ------------------------------------------------------------------------
紅豆餅	红豆饼	hong dou bing
車輪餅	车轮饼	che lun bing
太陽餅	太阳饼	tai yang bing
牛軋糖	牛轧糖	niu ga tang; niu zha tang
蕨餅	蕨饼	jue bing
潤餅	润饼	run bing
蔥抓餅	葱抓饼	cong zhua bing

# --- 粿: Mandarin `guo`, typed `gui` after Taiwanese kué -----------------------------------
粉粿	=	fen guo; fen gui
碗粿	=	wan guo; wan gui
草仔粿	=	cao zai guo; cao zai gui
紅龜粿	红龟粿	hong gui guo; hong gui gui
菜頭粿	菜头粿	cai tou guo; cai tou gui
鹹粿	咸粿	xian guo; xian gui
芋粿	=	yu guo; yu gui
發粿	发粿	fa guo; fa gui
粿仔條	粿仔条	guo zai tiao; gui zai tiao

# --- savoury ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
大腸麵線	大肠面线	da chang mian xian
鹹粥	咸粥	xian zhou
魷魚羹	鱿鱼羹	you yu geng
鼎邊銼	鼎边锉	ding bian cuo
米血	=	mi xue; mi xie
豬血糕	猪血糕	zhu xue gao; zhu xie gao
鹽水雞	盐水鸡	yan shui ji
鹹水雞	咸水鸡	xian shui ji
鹽酥雞	盐酥鸡	yan su ji
麻辣燙	麻辣烫	ma la tang
阿給	阿给	a gei
